{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":9,"exerciseID":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":9,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"九年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)0(2) $\\frac12$ (3)①45°② $\\frac{\\sqrt2}2$ ","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5ed76786a47b5ff8003181ba","queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","schCode":"0000","textbookId":"5ed740d9004931cec743eee9"}],"question":"看图做题。<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1841cb4a49a012v.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1841cb4cb3d013y.png\">","solution":"(1)平移线段FG至BH交AE于点K，如图1﹣1所示：由平移的性质得：FG∥BH，∵四边形ABCD是正方形，∴AB∥CD，AB＝BC，∠ABE＝∠C＝90°，∴四边形BFGH是平行四边形，∴BH＝FG，∵FG⊥AE，∴BH⊥AE，∴∠BKE＝90°，∴∠KBE+∠BEK＝90°，∵∠BEK+∠BAE＝90°，∴∠BAE＝∠CBH，在△ABE和△BCH中， $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\angle BAE=\\angle CBH\\\\AB=BC\\\\\\angle ABE=\\angle C\\end{array}\\right.$ ，∴△ABE≌△BCH（ASA），∴AE＝BH，∴AE＝FG；(2)将线段AB向右平移至FD处，使得点B与点D重合，连接CF，如图2所示：∴∠AOC＝∠FDC，设正方形网格的边长为单位1，则AC＝2，AF＝1，CE＝2，DE＝4，FG＝3，DG＝4，由勾股定理可得：CF $=\\sqrt{AC^2+AF^2}=\\sqrt{2^2+1^2}=\\sqrt5$ ，CD $=\\sqrt{CE^2+DE^2}=\\sqrt{2^2+4^2}=$ 2 $\\sqrt5$ ，DF $=\\sqrt{FG^2+DG^2}=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=$ 5，∵（ $\\sqrt5$ ）<sup>2</sup>+（2 $\\sqrt5$ ）<sup>2</sup>＝5<sup>2</sup>，∴CF<sup>2</sup>+CD<sup>2</sup>＝DF<sup>2</sup>，∴∠FCD＝90°，∴tan∠AOC＝tan∠FDC $=\\frac{CF}{CD}=\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2\\sqrt5}=\\frac12$ ；(3)①平移线段BC至DG处，连接GE，如图3﹣1所示：则∠DMC＝∠GDE，四边形DGBC是平行四边形，∴DC＝GB，∵四边形ADCP与四边形PBEF都是正方形，∴DC＝AD＝AP，BP＝BE，∠DAG＝∠GBE＝90°∴DC＝AD＝AP＝GB，∴AG＝BP＝BE，在△AGD和△BEG中， $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}AG=BE\\\\\\angle DAG=\\angle GBE\\\\AD=BG\\end{array}\\right.$ ，∴△AGD≌△BEG（SAS），∴DG＝EG，∠ADG＝∠EGB，∴∠EGB+∠AGD＝∠ADG+∠AGD＝90°，∴∠EGD＝90°，∴∠GDE＝∠GED＝45°，∴∠DMC＝∠GDE＝45°；②如图3﹣2所示：∵AC为正方形ADCP的对角线，∴AD＝CD，∠DAC＝∠PAC＝∠DMC＝45°，∴△ACD是等腰直角三角形，∴AC $=\\sqrt2$ AD，∵∠HCM＝∠BCA，∴∠AHD＝∠CHM＝∠ABC，∴△ADH∽△ACB，∴ $\\frac{DH}{BC}=\\frac{AD}{AC}=\\frac{AD}{\\sqrt2AD}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}2$ ．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/b228ff14-646b-408a-8691-b82beb697e21image51.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/b228ff14-646b-408a-8691-b82beb697e21image50.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/b228ff14-646b-408a-8691-b82beb697e21image49.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/b228ff14-646b-408a-8691-b82beb697e21image48.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/b228ff14-646b-408a-8691-b82beb697e21image47.png\">","subQueNum":3,"subQues":[{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"fQzWgtZJ6ukmgyTsauh","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","question":"如图1，在正方形ABCD中，E，F，G分别是BC，AB，CD上的点，FG⊥AE于点Q．求证：AE＝FG．","sortIndex":1},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"f3I34qqmhreqFe0M2l5","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","question":"如图2，正方形网格中，点A，B，C，D为格点，AB交CD于点O．求tan∠AOC的值；","sortIndex":2},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"rj0L9iIcl5mJQIimz9L","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","question":"如图3，点P是线段AB上的动点，分别以AP，BP为边在AB的同侧作正方形APCD与正方形PBEF，连接DE分别交线段BC，PC于点M，N．①求∠DMC的度数；②连接AC交DE于点H，直接写出 $\\frac{DH}{BC}$ 的值．","sortIndex":3}],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ebb5be8518ec3c65e1e86c1","knowName":"正方形的性质定理","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","sortIndex":811,"subQueId":"fQzWgtZJ6ukmgyTsauh"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ebb5be8518ec3c65e1e86c1","knowName":"正方形的性质定理","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","sortIndex":811,"subQueId":"rj0L9iIcl5mJQIimz9L"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ebb6027518ec3c65e1e86c6","knowName":"利用正方形的性质进行证明","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"queId":"01IhXQV6sShteygSE2T","sortIndex":817,"subQueId":"fQzWgtZJ6ukmgyTsauh"},{"coreFlag":1,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5